{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>זקן ושבע ימים</b> Three times in the Masorah: with Isaac and with Job — both of them righteous. And likewise with Abraham, זקן ושבע. And regarding the righteous it is said thus in praise, and regarding the wicked in disparagement: אדם ילוד אשה קצר ימים ושבע רוגז."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:46.290898047Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}